### Untuk VS Code extension "REST Client"
@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}

### Profil
GET {{host}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Daftar siswa
GET {{host}}/siswa?page=1&limit=10&search=emre&sort_by=nama_lengkap&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statistik
GET {{host}}/siswa/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail siswa
GET {{host}}/siswa/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tambah siswa
POST {{host}}/siswa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama_lengkap": "Budi Santoso",
  "jenis_kelamin": "Laki-laki",
  "alamat": "Jl. Mawar No. 5",
  "kelas": "XII",
  "jurusan": "RPL",
  "nipd": "242510099"
}

### Update sebagian
PATCH {{host}}/siswa/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alamat": "Jl. Melati No. 10"
}

### Hapus siswa
DELETE {{host}}/siswa/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
